不蒙封賞。建元初，為晉陵太守，有怨言。儉慮為禍，因褚彥回啟聞，中丞陸澄依事舉奏。詔以儉竭誠佐命，特降刑書宥遜，遠徙永嘉郡，於道伏誅。長子騫嗣。","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangjian:p014:m0052"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"本句所稱職號；其餘追贈與生前資序分別讀取。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008","text":"　　上曲宴羣臣數人，各使效伎藝，褚淵彈琵琶，王僧虔彈琴，沈文季歌《子夜》，張敬兒舞，王敬則拍張。儉曰：「臣無所解，唯知誦書。」因跪上前誦相如《封禪書》。上笑曰：「此盛德之事，吾何以堪之。」後上使陸澄誦《孝經》，自「仲尼居」而起。儉曰：「澄所謂博而寡要，臣請誦之。」乃誦「《君子之事上》」章。上曰：「善！張子布更覺非奇也。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0016","person_id":"jyx_72x_8t2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"褚淵"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0022","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"王僧虔"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0028","person_id":"408_ce3_5d8_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"沈文季"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0037","person_id":"stv_g27_gl2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"張敬兒"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0042","person_id":"7a0_95e_c4a","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":42,"end":45,"surface":"王敬則"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0048","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":48,"end":49,"surface":"儉"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0068","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","kind":"